a.600x338.jpg?t=1766164019"},{"id":12,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869780/ss_c94770dfdccd371e9a5a9ef4d52a5b7f71d4df92.1920x1080.jpg?t=1766164019","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869780/ss_c94770dfdccd371e9a5a9ef4d52a5b7f71d4df92.600x338.jpg?t=1766164019"}],"short_description":"Delve into the dangerous, ever-shifting labyrinth that is the Undermine. Discover, craft, and combine hundreds of unique items. Pair them with an ever-expanding roster of distinct playable characters for a new run every time! Grab a partner and uncover UnderMine 2's secrets together in local co-op.","steam_appid":1869780,"support_info":{"email":"support@thorium.gg","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Ukrainian","type":"game","website":"https://www.undermine2.game"}